<title>JAPAN: Kodensha - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kodensha - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 26.35		vs	   25.26</p>
<p> Operating	  975    million    vs	  723    million</p>
<p> Current	    984    million    vs	  684    million</p>
<p> Net		  344    million    vs	  224    million</p>
<p> EPS		   19.18 yen	  vs	   16.28 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     18 million	  vs	  14 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  8.00 yen	  vs	    8.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Kodensha Co Ltd is an electrical engineering firm.</p>
</text>
